"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1651737/87886e79-bdf6-4cc4-b223-b0bb3779895e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1651737/87886e79-bdf6-4cc4-b223-b0bb3779895e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"We are going abroad for work for a while and would like to sublet our very special detached house in Baierbrunn (20 minutes from downtown Munich) during this time. \n\nThe old coffee mill house in Baierbrunn was completely renovated in 2024 and exudes incredible charm.\nThe property will be rented furnished from November 1, 2025 (later move-in also possible) and has approx. 135 sqm of living space [150 sqm with sloping ceilings] and a basement (an additional 50 sqm), which is divided as follows:\n\n- On the ground floor, there is a guest bathroom and a large kitchen-diner with an old tiled stove.\n- On the first floor, there is a bathroom, two bedrooms, one of which is currently a children's room, and a small dressing room.\n- On the second floor, there is a converted attic, which currently serves as a study/gym and guest room.\n- The basement has also been completely renovated and includes a large storage room, a laundry room with a washing machine and dryer, as well as additional storage space in the boiler room and hallway.\n\nAnother special feature is the approximately 700 sqm completely fenced garden with 2 terraces, which are accessible from the kitchen.\n\nPrice and rental period:\nThe rental price includes all additional costs such as high-speed internet, television, and operating costs. Oil for heating in winter must be filled as needed. The house can also be heated via the fireplace.\nThe house is rented for 6-9 months, with the possibility of extension if both parties agree.\n\nTranslated with (hidden) (free version)","facilities":{"a